        {
          "locator": "line 23",
          "text": "CP-0 Findings and CP-1 reporting-entity register establish consolidated TD Group and controlled wholly-/majority-owned subsidiaries, with intercompany elimination and separately presented noncontrolling interests. This is not TransDigm Inc. standalone, a guarantor-only group or a covenant restricted group. CP-1A O01 establishes a publicly listed parent holding all TransDigm Inc. stock; O02/O04 leave ultimate beneficial control, voting arrangements and owner support unestablished. Public listing does not prove dispersed control or a sponsor backstop.",
          "formula": null,
          "cached_value": null,
          "hidden": false,
          "data_type": null,
          "number_format": null,
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "locator": "line 25",
          "text": "FY2024 covers **2023-10-01–2024-09-30**; FY2023 **2022-10-01–2023-09-30**; FY2022 **2021-10-01–2022-09-30**. Full balance-sheet comparatives are September 30, 2024 and 2023 instants; FY2022 does not have a full balance sheet in this foundation. The report/audit date is **2024-11-07**, after the analytical date; SEC filing availability was not independently established upstream. Annual comparative reclassifications follow the supplied report. No quarterly, LTM, constant-perimeter or transaction-pro-forma reconstruction is made.",
          "formula": null,
          "cached_value": null,
          "hidden": false,
          "data_type": null,
          "number_format": null,
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "locator": "line 27",
          "text": "Monetary figures below are **USD millions** unless explicitly identified otherwise. Reported GAAP values, issuer non-GAAP EBITDA, calculated ratios, debt principal/gross amounts and carrying values remain separate. Parentheses denote signed negative amounts where shown. Decimal margin/conversion ratios are fractions, not percentages. Missing observations are neither zero nor adverse evidence.",
