          "text": "**Analyst Interpretation; severity: Material.** Qualified-material shortages or weaker aircraft utilization/production could delay component shipments and replacement orders (**operational**, CP-1A B07/B08/B11) → point-in-time sales and customer order realization weaken (**revenue**, B09/E2) → lost absorption, unrecovered cost increases and adverse channel mix compress profitability (**margin**, E3) → receivables/inventory tie up cash while interest, taxes and operational investment continue (**cash**, E4) → cash committed to the dividend and conditional facility access limit the usable cushion (**liquidity**, E5) → a smaller EBITDA denominator and weak retained cash raise leverage pressure and dependence on external funding (**leverage/refinancing**, E6). This is a causal stress pathway, not a calculated outcome, breach prediction or default probability.",
